et-internships-volunteering-applications-ghosting/</link><description>对于美国、加拿大和英国的青少年来说，夏季就业市场一直在“摧毁他们的灵魂”，但有些人正在找到进入的方法。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/GettyImages-2215595712-e1786134602482.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Sun, 09 Aug 2026 10:00:00 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/08/09/teenager-summer-job-market-internships-volunteering-applications-ghosting/</guid></item><item><title>戴维森学院院长：上大学值得吗？看看新的答案</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/08/09/davidson-college-president-is-college-worth-it-take-a-look-at-a-new-answer/</link><description>毕业六个月后，我们 2025 届 95% 的学生找到工作或在读研究生。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/hicks.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Sun, 09 Aug 2026 09:30:00 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/08/09/davidson-college-president-is-college-worth-it-take-a-look-at-a-new-answer/</guid></item><item><title>一名 Z 世代员工因提前 10 分钟下班而被首席执行官训斥。职场专家争论谁错了</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/08/09/gen-z-worker-etiquette-ceo-leaving-10-minutes-early-workplace-culture-boomers-millennials/</link><description>“这正常吗？”一场新的职场礼仪争论是由一名年轻员工因提前下班而与高层领导发生麻烦而引发的。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/GettyImages-962224288-e1786050659603.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Sun, 09 Aug 2026 09:00:00 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/08/09/gen-z-worker-etiquette-ceo-leaving-10-minutes-early-workplace-culture-boomers-millennials/</guid></item><item><title>特朗普家族寻求增加预测市场影响力，卡尔希打击内幕交易</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/08/09/kalshi-insider-trump-truth-social-prediction-markets-polymarket/</link><description>预测市场正在与政府纠缠在一起，卡尔希正试图证明它正在监管内幕交易。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/GettyImages-2281484042-e1786140971868.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Sun, 09 